# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  301 REDIRECTS FROM THE OLD WORDPRESS SITE
#
#  Cloudflare Pages reads this file automatically. One rule per
#  line: old path, new path, status code.
#
#  301 = permanent. It tells Google the page has moved for good
#  and passes the accumulated ranking across. A 302 does not.
#
#  These cover every URL that was live on the old site. Without
#  them, six years of Google ranking 404s silently on the day
#  the domain switches over.
#
#  Before launch: check Google Search Console on the current
#  site to see which of these actually receive traffic, and
#  adjust the destinations accordingly.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

